# Design.md §12 Step E2 — keeps adapter image build contexts small and,
# more importantly, keeps real secrets (nsc's Operator/Account/User store,
# generated .creds files) out of any image layer. Compose mounts the one
# .creds file each adapter actually needs at runtime instead (Step E1) —
# nothing under infra/nats/operator/ should ever be COPYed into an image.

.git/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

infra/nats/operator/
infra/nats/resolver.conf
infra/files/

.env
.DS_Store
